  "description": "Image codecs and processing in pure C# with no dependencies and no native code. Decodes JPEG, PNG, GIF, BMP and WebP (lossy, lossless, alpha, the first frame of animations); encodes JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF and BMP. Reads picture sizes from headers, keeps ICC colour profiles, applies EXIF orientation, resizes, rotates, flips and crops. Hardened for untrusted uploads.",
